commit f4d03a133cadc70b51068fd0c6d2990b7fcf1ff6
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:38:48 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board for the committee's task sheet
    
    One section per person so each member can find what is theirs (minutes
    12 Nov), with unowned tasks first because unowned items are what kept
    stalling (water meter, shed gutter), overdue items marked, and done items
    folded away (Tomas's request).
    
    The kit's event layout folds sections whose date has passed; grouped by
    person, that would have hidden anyone with an overdue task. So board.py
    gains a dateless-section mode plus row sorting, a done fold, date columns
    and column prefixes. The events board renders the same as before.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

