 Reads boards/<name>/board.json and the CSV file it names ("data", relative to the board's folder) and writes
 boards/<name>/index.html. Rows are grouped into sections by the "section" field and ordered by the earliest date
 in each section; sections whose date has passed go under one fold at the bottom.
+
+A board with no "date" in "section" (the tasks board) has no past fold: sections are in name order, with rows that
+have no section value ("section.empty", default "Other") first. Optional keys for such boards: "sort" (a date field
+to order rows by within a section), "done_label" (rows with status done leave their section for one fold at the
+bottom), and per column "date": true (shown as "due <date>", marked overdue once passed and not done) and "prefix".
